{%- comment -%}
  Optional licensed Helvetica Now webfont (client override of the brand book's Inter).
  Off by default: the system stack "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif is used.
  Note: Android maps Helvetica/Arial to Roboto; Windows renders Arial.

  To enable once Monotype WOFF2 files are licensed (web licence is pageview-based):
  1. Upload to /assets with exactly these names:
       HelveticaNowText-Regular.woff2   (400)
       HelveticaNowText-Medium.woff2    (500)
       HelveticaNowText-Bold.woff2      (700)
       HelveticaNowDisplay-Bold.woff2   (700, headings)
  2. Theme Editor → Vettofit PDP → Typography → tick "Use licensed Helvetica Now webfont".
  3. For best LCP, move this render into layout/theme.liquid <head> instead.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'HelveticaNowText-Regular.woff2' | asset_url | preload_tag: as: 'font', type: 'font/woff2', crossorigin: 'anonymous' }}
<style>
  @font-face { font-family: "Helvetica Now Text"; src: url("{{ 'HelveticaNowText-Regular.woff2' | asset_url }}") format("woff2"); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; }
  @font-face { font-family: "Helvetica Now Text"; src: url("{{ 'HelveticaNowText-Medium.woff2' | asset_url }}") format("woff2"); font-weight: 500; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; }
  @font-face { font-family: "Helvetica Now Text"; src: url("{{ 'HelveticaNowText-Bold.woff2' | asset_url }}") format("woff2"); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; }
  @font-face { font-family: "Helvetica Now Display"; src: url("{{ 'HelveticaNowDisplay-Bold.woff2' | asset_url }}") format("woff2"); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; }
  :root {
    --vf-font-text: "Helvetica Now Text", var(--vf-font-system);
    --vf-font-display: "Helvetica Now Display", "Helvetica Now Text", var(--vf-font-system);
  }
</style>
